A button above the recipe list opens a panel that picks a random recipe.
Optional conditions: category, favorites only, low GI only and a maximum
SJ per portion (recipes without servings and weight are skipped while it
is set). "Iný návrh" never repeats the recipe shown. Texts in Slovak and
Czech; app-shell cache bumped to v11.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
